sequenceDiagram
    actor A as Analyst
    participant C as Web console
    participant F as FastAPI
    participant D as Detector (classifier + Isolation Forest)
    participant E as Explainer (TreeSHAP)
    participant T as Threat map (ATT&CK)
    A->>C: Start replay
    loop every second while replaying
        C->>F: GET /replay?cursor&n
        F->>D: predict + anomaly (batch)
        D-->>F: classes, outlier flags
        F->>E: top_features (flagged flows)
        E-->>F: SHAP top-5 per alert
        F->>T: context_for (class)
        T-->>F: technique, tactic, severity, response
        F-->>C: flows + alerts (JSON)
        C-->>A: alert queue, KPIs, network map
    end
    A->>C: open alert
    C-->>A: why (SHAP), candidate technique, response
    A->>C: Confirm / Dismiss (kept in the browser)
